OL,3,GNEWSAYour guide to Shrewsbury Pride -
OL,4,Awhat you need to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands are expected to flock to
OL,7,FShrewsbury this week for the town's
OL,8,Fannual Pride celebrations.
OL,10,FIt features three days of events which
OL,11,Forganisers say is entirely funded by
OL,12,Fdonations and run by volunteers.
OL,14,FThe event debuted in 2023, with
OL,15,Forganisers saying it was a major step
OL,16,Fforward for the town.
OL,18,FHere is everything you can get involved
OL,19,Fwith across the weekend:
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
